SUMMARY:The Single Source of Truth: Building Data Foundations for Agentic 
 AI
DESCRIPTION:Data Science Raleigh\nTraditional data management was built to
  give humans consistent\, trustworthy records to work from. Agentic AI dem
 ands something more dynamic: data that agents can query\, reason over\, an
 d act on continuously\, without waiting for a human to interpret it first.
  That shift changes what "good" data actually looks like.\n\nThis webinar 
 explores how data foundations must evolve to support agentic AI—moving f
 rom static\, periodically-updated records toward connected\, real-time\, m
 achine-consumable data. We'll cover what it takes to make data not just ac
 curate\, but usable by autonomous systems making decisions at machine spee
 d.\n\n**Key Takeaways:**\n\n1️⃣ **Rethinking "Good" Data:** How agenti
 c AI changes the requirements for data quality and structure.\n\n2️⃣ *
 *Real-Time Unification:** Why static\, periodic data processes fall short 
 for continuously acting agents.\n\n3️⃣ **Machine-Readable Trust:** Des
 igning authoritative records that agents can reliably reason over.\n\n4️
 ⃣ **Data Stewardship for Autonomy:** How data ownership roles must adapt
  as agents become primary data consumers.\n\n**[Register here](https://dat
 asciconnect.com/events/webinars/single-source-of-truth/)**
